{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "20479",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.95,
      "end_seconds": 4.94,
      "duration_seconds": 3.99,
      "text": "Hi, doctor, I hope I'm not disturbing you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.81,
      "end_seconds": 10.28,
      "duration_seconds": 4.47,
      "text": "Of course, leave it there. How can I help?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 12.37,
      "end_seconds": 19.76,
      "duration_seconds": 7.39,
      "text": "Honestly, it's a mole that has changed, and my family pushed me to come."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 20.32,
      "end_seconds": 24.86,
      "duration_seconds": 4.54,
      "text": "Alright, when was the first time you noticed it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 25.82,
      "end_seconds": 44.55,
      "duration_seconds": 18.73,
      "text": "About... well, about a year. I took the morning off to come in today. As for dark patch with an uneven edge, I honestly can't say when that began. It might have been last month or the month before."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 44.92,
      "end_seconds": 46.21,
      "duration_seconds": 1.29,
      "text": "Yes, carry on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 54.31,
      "end_seconds": 56.97,
      "duration_seconds": 2.66,
      "text": "Let's start with the basic checks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 68.91,
      "end_seconds": 71.11,
      "duration_seconds": 2.2,
      "text": "Okay, this won't take long..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 83.16,
      "end_seconds": 98.12,
      "duration_seconds": 14.96,
      "text": "Okay: respiratory rate 18, weight 97 kilos, height 175 centimetres. And BP is 109 over 77, temperature 36.4, pulse is 76 beats a minute, SpO2 99 percent on room air."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 100.52,
      "end_seconds": 105.2,
      "duration_seconds": 4.68,
      "text": "I'd like to check you over now, if that's alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 106.81,
      "end_seconds": 109.04,
      "duration_seconds": 2.23,
      "text": "I'm just checking this side."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 117.94,
      "end_seconds": 126.7,
      "duration_seconds": 8.76,
      "text": "There is a dark, six-millimetre mole with an irregular border and two shades of brown on the upper back."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 127.68,
      "end_seconds": 129.66,
      "duration_seconds": 1.98,
      "text": "Raise your arm for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 145.59,
      "end_seconds": 149.63,
      "duration_seconds": 4.04,
      "text": "I can't feel any glands in the armpit or neck."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 153.95,
      "end_seconds": 163.78,
      "duration_seconds": 9.83,
      "text": "Okay, that's the examination finished. And what about weight loss, lumps in the armpit, other new moles or night sweats?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 165.56,
      "end_seconds": 175.9,
      "duration_seconds": 10.34,
      "text": "Okay, so no weight loss, lumps in the armpit, other new moles or night sweats, none of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 176.41,
      "end_seconds": 179.27,
      "duration_seconds": 2.86,
      "text": "Yes. Any family history of melanoma?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 180.53,
      "end_seconds": 183.42,
      "duration_seconds": 2.89,
      "text": "Nope, no family history of melanoma."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 184.49,
      "end_seconds": 188.8,
      "duration_seconds": 4.31,
      "text": "What about your tummy and bowels, anything unusual there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 189.89,
      "end_seconds": 191.88,
      "duration_seconds": 1.99,
      "text": "No, all normal there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 193.16,
      "end_seconds": 196.1,
      "duration_seconds": 2.94,
      "text": "Have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 197.1,
      "end_seconds": 200.2,
      "duration_seconds": 3.1,
      "text": "Nothing, I haven't had any operations."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 202.06,
      "end_seconds": 206.58,
      "duration_seconds": 4.52,
      "text": "Let's talk a little about your daily life and habits."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 207.63,
      "end_seconds": 224.01,
      "duration_seconds": 16.38,
      "text": "I only drink at family occasions. No, I've never smoked in my life. I swim twice a week. I'm a plumber, lots of bending and kneeling. No, I share a house with my brother."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 242.5,
      "end_seconds": 248.83,
      "duration_seconds": 6.33,
      "text": "Do you have any long-term conditions? Bear with me, I'm just building up the picture."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 250.41,
      "end_seconds": 252.52,
      "duration_seconds": 2.11,
      "text": "I've got high cholesterol."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 253.8,
      "end_seconds": 255.09,
      "duration_seconds": 1.29,
      "text": "Okay, go on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 268.47,
      "end_seconds": 273.54,
      "duration_seconds": 5.07,
      "text": "Are you allergic to anything? Any allergies to medicines or foods?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 274.28,
      "end_seconds": 277.98,
      "duration_seconds": 3.7,
      "text": "No, nothing as far as I know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 279.73,
      "end_seconds": 282.03,
      "duration_seconds": 2.3,
      "text": "Let's run through your medicines."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 283.34,
      "end_seconds": 293.06,
      "duration_seconds": 9.72,
      "text": "Atorvastatin, 20 milligrams, at night for my cholesterol. My sister suggested writing things down, but I forgot."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 293.99,
      "end_seconds": 304.46,
      "duration_seconds": 10.47,
      "text": "Putting it all together, I'd lean towards a pigmented lesion that needs removal for a proper diagnosis. Let's get a skin biopsy, for changing mole."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CLINICAL_STAFF",
      "start_seconds": 305.64,
      "end_seconds": 309.1,
      "duration_seconds": 3.46,
      "text": "I can book that for Friday at 10 am."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 310.23,
      "end_seconds": 325.9,
      "duration_seconds": 15.67,
      "text": "I think a dermoscopy makes sense here, for changing mole. Cover up and use factor 50 sunscreen on exposed skin. I'd like you to see the skin cancer clinic as well, and I'll write the referral."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 326.7,
      "end_seconds": 327.4,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 328.98,
      "end_seconds": 336.04,
      "duration_seconds": 7.06,
      "text": "I'd like to see you again after the biopsy results. Anything else on your mind before you go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 339.69,
      "end_seconds": 341.94,
      "duration_seconds": 2.25,
      "text": "Alright, thanks, take care."
    }
  ]
}